{"id":400608101,"chapter_id":21000101,"scene_id":105,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"幻月之下，悬浮着可怖的怪物。污秽覆盖她全身，面具遮蔽她的脸庞。但你知道她在看你。","style":3,"background":2067,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"混沌的声音","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你没有离开，你选择回来。我知道你会这么做……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_400607101_04"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06071","style":1,"background":4110,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"混沌的声音","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>这是你的来处，也是你的归途。她，他们都在这里，都在等你……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_400607101_05"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06071","style":1,"background":4110,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"混沌的声音","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>等你找到回来的路……</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_400607101_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_06071","style":1,"background":4110,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"options":["我有想要回去的地方"],"jump":[7],"style":6,"background":4110,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但不是这里。她也一样。","style":2,"background":4110,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"所以我回来，带她一起离开。","style":2,"background":4110,"log_type":1}]}